以与他们进行通讯——并理解他们先前的广播。\n\n尽管最初我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]持怀疑态度，但看起来我们获取的这些信号确实就是他们的语言，只不过对于我们的[This.Owner.GetSpeciesEarNamePlural]非常地难以接受罢了。尽管我们的大多数回应尝试并没有让他们理解，但他们似乎对我们的拙劣模仿感到被冒犯，特别是因为我们不幸地反复发出了一个和他们语言中最粗鲁的羞辱非常相似的声音。要改变这一第一印象需要花费我们很长时间了。","en":"We have managed to decipher enough of the language used by the civilization we now know to be the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] to open communications with them - and to make sense of their earlier broadcasts.\n\nIt seems that - despite the initial skepticism of our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] - the signals we picked up truly did form their language, which is simply uniquely unpalatable to our [This.Owner.GetSpeciesEarNamePlural]. While most of our attempted response did not make a great deal of sense to them, it seems that they are somewhat insulted by our poor imitation, especially since we had the misfortune to - repeatedly - make a sound that is very similar to one of the crudest insults used in their language. It will take quite some time for us to live down this first impression..."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/091130d77fee1dd0b5b0.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.377.A","label":{"zh":"令人遗憾的错误。","en":"A regrettable mistake."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12461","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c12461","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","sco